    "title": "Rocco Forte's Fulvio Pierangelini Takes His Culinary Voice to the Vatican - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago For Fulvio Pierangelini, Creative Director of Food for Rocco Forte Hotels, the invitation to contribute to a major new exhibition at the Vatican Apostolic Library represents an extraordinary professional honor. This September, the celebrated Italian chef will join internationally acclaimed artist JR and typographer Bill Moran as one of three contemporary voices invited to interpret the Library’s historic collections for AQVA: Catastrophe and Wonder, the opening exhibition in a new five-year cultural program. Read full article",
